  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Based Violence What Works in Prevention, Response and Mitigation across the Rohingya  refugee camps, Cox&#x2019;s Bazar, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of this study is to understand what works to reduce GBV in the Rohingya refugee camps and local host communities of Cox&#x2019;s Bazar. It should involve key stakeholders and should generate evidence and learning on approaches that show most potential for impact.</narrative>
  </description>
